17: /// into one run in first-seen order, so each selected project writes one TRX. The filter is the lane's host platform
18: /// clause (<see cref="IntegrationLaneFilter.PlatformClause"/>) and class clause
19: /// (<see cref="IntegrationLaneClassFilter.ClassClause"/>), with no category clause; the run record, log line and TRX name
